     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div vlink=\"#954F72\" link=\"#0563C1\" lang=\"SV\">\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Tahoma;color:#000000;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<div>Dear all,</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>postdoc that may be interesting in this audience.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best regards  -- Marc</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<hr>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Tord Snäll [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tord....@slu.se</a>]<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 16 December 2020 08:59<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Tord Snäll<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Postdoc: Biodiversity modelling and scenario analysis<br>\r\n</font><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I would appreciate help to spread the ad for this postdoc position.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Biodiversity modelling and scenario analysis</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Duties: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Depending on your expertise, you will developing models for the spatial distribution or dynamics of forest species, or make projections using available models for biodiversity\r\n and ecosystem services assuming scenarios. We study how scenarios of socio-economic policy or development, climate change or forest management on different spatial scales (global, EU, landscape) may affect the future delivery of ecosystem services, biodiversity\r\n and human wellbeing. We also investigate conflicts and synergies between these, e.g. based on optimization. The work is funded by Formas and our ERA Net projects BioESSHealth (<a href=\"http://www.biodiversa.org/1400\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biodiversa.org/1400&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494061079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07cYqXyCcYnuiUhjkoDqtY\">www.biodiversa.org/1400</a>)\r\n and Multiforest.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><a href=\"https://www.slu.se/en/about-slu/work-at-slu/jobs-vacancies/?rmpage=job&amp;rmjob=4377&amp;rmlang=UK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.slu.se/en/about-slu/work-at-slu/jobs-vacancies/?rmpage%3Djob%26rmjob%3D4377%26rmlang%3DUK&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494061079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YX0BfDgNuSTJfoP2VSnrK\">https://www.slu.se/en/about-slu/work-at-slu/jobs-vacancies/?rmpage=job&amp;rmjob=4377&amp;rmlang=UK</a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Best regards,<br>\r\nTord</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\">--<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Tord Snäll<br>\r\nProfessor</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Sveriges lantbruksuniversitet<br>\r\nSwedish University of Agricultural Sciences</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">SLU ArtDatabanken/SLU Swedish Species Information Centre</span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Box 7007, SE-750 07 Uppsala</span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Besöksadress: Almas allé 8E\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Telefon: <a href=\"tel:+46%2018%2067%2026%2012\" value=\"+4618672612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+46(0)18-67 26 12</a>, Mobil: <a href=\"tel:+46%2076%20766%2026%2012\" value=\"+46767662612\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+46(0)76-766 26 12</a></span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494061079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LBpc7Loj6RUE2DduLjuq6\"><span style=\"color:blue\">www.slu.se/artdatabanken</span></a></span><span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494061079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2H-eFZkzczaKL2i5bkIDXX\"><span style=\"color:blue\">www.slu.se/artdatabanken/tordsnall</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red;background:white\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>---<br>\r\nNär du skickar e-post till SLU så innebär detta att SLU behandlar dina personuppgifter. För att läsa mer om hur detta går till, klicka\r\n<a href=\"https://www.slu.se/om-slu/kontakta-slu/personuppgifter/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.slu.se/om-slu/kontakta-slu/personuppgifter/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494061079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XBnzbVFSnSI_nANvYmxJE\">\r\nhär </a><br>\r\nE-